     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">np.array([[1, 2], [1, 2], [1, 2]])</code> creates an <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">ndarray</code> of 3 by 2. The <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">T</code> operator transposes the array. The transpose operator takes an array of <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">m</code> by <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">n</code> and converts the array to an <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">n</code> by <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">m</code> array. The result of applying the transpose operator on the given array is a 2 by 3 array."
    }
